WEBVTT

00:17.800 --> 00:18.790
Karane!

00:22.340 --> 00:23.690
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:24.280 --> 00:28.300
I-It's not like I'm happy to see you 
rush to me all out of breath

00:28.300 --> 00:31.630
even though you're five minutes 
early or anything, okay?

00:33.080 --> 00:36.010
R-Right. I'm sorry.

00:36.010 --> 00:37.010
Huh?

00:37.300 --> 00:42.310
If you were 30 minutes early, 
I should've been here two hours early.

00:42.710 --> 00:44.040
I'm supposed to be the boyfriend.

00:44.040 --> 00:45.640
Hey, Rentaro?

00:46.090 --> 00:52.410
A guy with 11 whole girlfriends 
is nothing but a burden.

00:52.870 --> 00:56.450
I really don't have any right to call 
myself your boyfriend anymore.

00:59.930 --> 01:01.990
H-Hold up!

01:03.350 --> 01:04.460
Wait!

01:04.730 --> 01:05.950
Rentaro!

01:05.950 --> 01:07.960
Wait... Rentaro!

01:09.010 --> 01:10.340
Rentaro!

01:17.790 --> 01:19.630
A-A dream?

01:43.700 --> 01:48.910
<b>The 100 Girlfriends
Who Really, Really, Really, Really,
REALLY Love You</b>

01:49.740 --> 01:52.580
Karane

01:49.740 --> 01:52.580
as the
Tsundere Princess

01:52.580 --> 01:54.870
Mei

01:52.580 --> 01:54.870
Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep

01:54.870 --> 01:56.460
Hakari

01:54.870 --> 01:56.460
Suggestive Weight-Loss
Running

01:56.460 --> 01:57.710
Kurumi

01:56.460 --> 01:57.710
Ate all of the
school store's bread

01:57.710 --> 01:59.210
Mimimi

01:57.710 --> 01:59.210
(Getting ready)
Two hours later

02:00.380 --> 02:02.920
Nano

02:00.380 --> 02:02.920
Robot that
exercises for her

02:02.920 --> 02:05.340
Shizuka

02:02.920 --> 02:05.340
Has 365 book
recommendations
this week

02:05.340 --> 02:07.640
Kusuri

02:05.340 --> 02:07.640
Has newly developed
drug that gives
you sweet dreams

02:07.640 --> 02:08.300
Hahari

02:07.640 --> 02:08.300
Chairperson's Address
"Education" and "Love"

02:08.300 --> 02:08.970
Iku

02:08.300 --> 02:08.970
Has been doing
push-ups since yesterday

02:08.970 --> 02:10.510
Meme

02:08.970 --> 02:10.510
Customized Plushy-
Rentaro-kun

02:10.640 --> 02:15.350
<b>Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening</b>

02:18.110 --> 02:19.780
Meme-san added ears

02:18.110 --> 02:19.780
and a tail for you!

02:25.410 --> 02:27.450
<b>Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening</b>

03:00.430 --> 03:02.280
Check this out, girls!

03:02.280 --> 03:06.040
<b>Heart Sable</b>

03:02.600 --> 03:04.100
I-Is that...

03:04.100 --> 03:06.040
The viral snack!

03:06.040 --> 03:07.160
Do you mean Hato?!

03:07.160 --> 03:11.530
Heart Sable, said to bring happiness 
to lovers who share them.

03:11.880 --> 03:14.280
Wow, you managed to buy them?

03:14.280 --> 03:16.550
He must've shed blood, sweat, and tears.

03:16.550 --> 03:20.300
Let's split the 12 into 12 
even pieces and share them all!

03:20.300 --> 03:22.600
Yay!

03:22.600 --> 03:23.980
The Duodecential Darlings.

03:23.980 --> 03:27.930
I-I have no interest in something so stupid.

03:34.830 --> 03:36.550
<i>"Is it destinilicious?"</i>

03:37.470 --> 03:39.170
Say aah, aye.

03:39.170 --> 03:40.180
Aah.

03:49.080 --> 03:49.800
Here.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.920
You say aah too.

03:54.890 --> 03:55.540
Th...

03:55.890 --> 03:58.300
Th-Th...

03:59.450 --> 04:02.270
Think you can take my cash 
in return? Think again!

04:02.270 --> 04:04.300
There are better ways to shake someone down.

04:05.100 --> 04:09.310
<i>Why can't I even say a simple "thank you"?</i>

04:09.660 --> 04:13.570
<i>The more I fall for Rentaro, the less 
I'm able to express my feelings.</i>

04:13.570 --> 04:14.400
H-Hmph!

04:14.860 --> 04:18.120
I'll teach you how to eat these, 
since you don't have a clue!

04:17.400 --> 04:18.610
<b>Splornk</b>

04:18.120 --> 04:19.230
Yum!

04:19.230 --> 04:21.650
A feast for the eyes, literally.

04:21.650 --> 04:24.480
<i>"Now this is a big ol' surprise."</i>

04:21.650 --> 04:27.530
krrrrr

04:24.480 --> 04:27.530
I can get three times 
the flavor if I use my eyes!

04:24.650 --> 04:27.530
<i>Nobody else has any issues being nice.</i>

04:27.880 --> 04:30.120
<i>If I can't change, then eventually...</i>

04:30.120 --> 04:32.590
What's the matter, Karane-san?

04:32.590 --> 04:35.580
Oh, are you having growing pains?

04:35.580 --> 04:37.560
A-round-the-chest?

04:37.560 --> 04:42.220
It sucked for me too!

04:47.330 --> 04:49.450
S-Sorry, Hakari.

04:49.900 --> 04:51.630
So yum.

04:57.240 --> 04:59.570
You then thread this through here...

04:59.960 --> 05:01.820
<i>"I understand completely."</i>

05:01.820 --> 05:04.820
Let me tell you about the char siu 
at the new ramen place by the station.

05:04.820 --> 05:08.070
It was so huge, it was like mammoth meat.

05:08.070 --> 05:09.700
<b>World Peace</b>

05:08.370 --> 05:09.700
Ready...

05:09.700 --> 05:13.130
Sumo honorably!

05:10.350 --> 05:13.130
Rawr!

05:13.700 --> 05:16.080
Go harder. Put your legs into it.

05:16.370 --> 05:18.040
<b>Be-yoo-tee!!</b>

05:16.390 --> 05:17.710
That's your cue!

05:17.710 --> 05:19.680
Good luck, you two.

05:20.090 --> 05:20.840
There!

05:21.110 --> 05:22.340
She stronk, aye!

05:22.340 --> 05:24.130
Nice fight, indeed.

05:24.130 --> 05:26.890
Time to reveal true form 
with Reversing Medicine!

05:26.890 --> 05:28.720
You sound like one of those <i>DQ</i> final bosses.

05:30.040 --> 05:31.320
What is it?

05:31.320 --> 05:36.510
Ooh, that despair of seeing a boss you 
scraped through return with a new health bar!

05:36.510 --> 05:38.440
I had no idea you played video games.

05:39.030 --> 05:41.230
My kid brother used to make me.

05:41.580 --> 05:44.020
The second loop of 
<i>Ghosts 'n Goblins</i> is just the best.

05:44.020 --> 05:45.600
That game for masochists?

05:47.230 --> 05:52.410
Messed up and brought the
De-Tsundere-fy Medicine I made by mistake.

05:52.990 --> 05:54.040
Screw it!

05:54.040 --> 05:57.150
Gonna win in this form!

05:57.150 --> 05:58.960
That's the spirit! Beautiful!

05:57.150 --> 06:01.040
Ready? Sumo honorably!

05:58.960 --> 05:59.990
You've got guts.

06:11.300 --> 06:21.180
Sumo honorably!

06:14.060 --> 06:16.180
Keep going! Harder!

06:19.370 --> 06:20.440
There!

06:22.070 --> 06:23.660
Oh, sor—

06:24.570 --> 06:28.090
S-Sorry, Karane!
Please don't be mad, aye?

06:28.090 --> 06:30.120
C-Calm down, Karane-chan.

06:30.120 --> 06:31.880
That was a beautiful collision.

06:31.880 --> 06:35.520
It is my responsibility as referee. 
If you must punish someone, punish me.

06:35.520 --> 06:36.580
No, me please.

06:36.580 --> 06:38.580
<b>menacing</b>

06:38.580 --> 06:40.960
Forgive me, aye!

06:42.770 --> 06:45.090
Don't worry. It's okay, Kusuri-chan.

06:45.090 --> 06:47.090
Find me dead in Miyagi!

06:52.340 --> 06:55.470
Th-That's the... Tsunderays!

06:55.470 --> 06:56.970
Tsunderays?!

06:57.280 --> 07:01.070
No... Didja drink the 
De-Tsundere-Fy Medicine, Karane?!

07:01.070 --> 07:02.730
Uh, what kinda drug is that?!

07:04.010 --> 07:07.110
It de-tsundere-fies the drinker.

07:07.110 --> 07:08.130
Too long; didn't explain!

07:08.130 --> 07:09.860
Likely cut for time again.

07:13.210 --> 07:15.090
The lights are fading away...

07:15.090 --> 07:17.240
They went out in a blaze of beauty.

07:17.530 --> 07:19.950
Anyway, are you okay, Karane?

07:20.610 --> 07:22.690
Yeah, I'm fine,

07:22.690 --> 07:23.960
Rentaro-kun.

07:23.960 --> 07:26.680
"Rentaro-kun"?!

07:27.630 --> 07:30.260
I-Is this really our Karane-chan?!

07:30.260 --> 07:32.590
<i>"Karane-san of all people..."</i>

07:32.590 --> 07:34.420
She's like Two Face!

07:34.420 --> 07:35.890
Which is which?

07:37.510 --> 07:39.950
Um, I'm sorry, Kusuri-chan.

07:39.950 --> 07:42.030
I shouldn't have taken your drug 
without permission.

07:42.030 --> 07:44.710
Uh, that part fine...

07:44.710 --> 07:46.520
The heck? This pretty awkward.

07:47.490 --> 07:49.900
Kusuri stand a chance against Karane now!

07:50.590 --> 07:51.970
Ready?

07:51.970 --> 07:55.150
Sumo honorably!

07:52.520 --> 07:55.190
Rawr! Suicide dive!

07:56.160 --> 07:59.410
Hooray! Kusuri beat Karane, aye!

07:59.700 --> 08:03.290
Hehe, you really love sumo wrestling.

08:03.290 --> 08:07.340
Watched with Gran-Gran since little.

08:07.340 --> 08:10.550
Sumo wrestlers super stronk! 
Like superhuman monsters!

08:10.550 --> 08:15.020
Wait, so Karane's strength came 
from her tsundere energy?

08:15.020 --> 08:17.340
You mean it was the mentality?

08:17.340 --> 08:22.310
If anything, the tsundereness brainwashed 
her and removed her limiters!

08:22.760 --> 08:23.810
Gulp.

08:24.120 --> 08:27.810
Karane, try hitting me 
as hard as you can with this bat.

08:27.810 --> 08:30.570
Iku-chan? O-Okay.

08:33.320 --> 08:34.650
Take that!

08:37.730 --> 08:41.660
<i>"The face of a warrior 
hit with the ultimate betrayal."</i>

08:41.660 --> 08:44.460
Despair, too, is a form a beauty.

08:44.460 --> 08:48.500
How good can she kiss? Let me try 
kissing her and see what she's got.

08:48.500 --> 08:49.710
For what purpose?

08:49.710 --> 08:51.530
Huh? Er...

08:51.530 --> 08:53.690
It'd be one thing if she were still tsundere,

08:53.690 --> 08:58.490
but taking advantage of this ordinary 
girl is probably out of the question.

08:58.490 --> 09:00.970
What do ya even make 
the usual Karane out to be?

09:01.260 --> 09:03.930
U-Uh, Hakari-chan?

09:03.930 --> 09:04.600
Yes?

09:04.600 --> 09:09.360
Hakari-chan, your um... 
ample bosoms are touching me.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.860
What do you think?

09:13.170 --> 09:16.040
They're big and soft...

09:16.040 --> 09:18.820
And so squishy... They're magical.

09:18.820 --> 09:22.030
So that's what you always thought of them.

09:22.030 --> 09:24.010
Who's taking advantage of her now?!

09:24.010 --> 09:25.120
Rotten tree, rotten apple.

09:25.120 --> 09:28.500
And what do you think of
my resplendent beauty?

09:28.800 --> 09:30.730
Huh? Uh...

09:30.730 --> 09:32.500
I think it's beautiful.

09:32.500 --> 09:34.600
Mm, indeed!

09:32.670 --> 09:34.090
<b>Mm, indeed!</b>

09:34.600 --> 09:38.640
Unlike the usual Inda Karane, 
she's frank and efficient.

09:38.640 --> 09:42.030
<i>"Enough, you knaves! She's not yer plaything!"</i>

09:42.030 --> 09:43.890
We should leave her be.

09:44.240 --> 09:48.480
Shizuka-chan, Meme-chan, u-um...

09:49.420 --> 09:55.560
I wanted to learn how to 
crochet with you too.

09:55.560 --> 09:57.900
Is it okay if I join you?

10:00.190 --> 10:04.020
You thread this through... Yes, that's it.

10:02.230 --> 10:04.020
Wow.

10:06.000 --> 10:09.670
<b>Paraiso</b>

10:07.160 --> 10:08.540
<i>Is this paradise?</i>

10:11.980 --> 10:16.580
She's cute and nice, unlike the train wreck 
that is the usual Karane-san.

10:16.580 --> 10:17.570
Hakari...

10:17.570 --> 10:19.680
Sure, I think she's really cute.

10:19.950 --> 10:20.830
But...

10:21.540 --> 10:24.180
I loved the old Karane too.

10:28.580 --> 10:33.570
You're right. The tsundere Karane-chan was 
cute enough to make you spew blood too.

10:33.890 --> 10:38.200
And I think she was 
very kind, even as a tsundere.

10:38.200 --> 10:40.450
<i>"A boss lady with a heart of gold."</i>

10:40.800 --> 10:43.080
The inefficiency made her who she was.

10:43.480 --> 10:48.080
It would be a shame to never see 
the original Karane-sama again.

10:48.080 --> 10:52.330
I could never take her place 
as the family's straight man.

10:52.330 --> 10:54.590
Her quips were beautiful.

10:54.590 --> 10:57.290
Wanna hear Karane's quips!

10:57.290 --> 10:59.840
Kusuri gonna make some Tsunderefying Medicine!

11:01.340 --> 11:05.630
Well, I personally don't mind her 
staying the way she is now,

11:05.630 --> 11:08.350
but if that's how you all feel...

11:08.660 --> 11:09.990
You girls.

11:10.730 --> 11:14.170
Yeah, make that Tsunderefying Medicine!

11:14.170 --> 11:16.500
Anything I can do to help?

11:16.500 --> 11:18.500
Nah, too risky to have amateur in lab.

11:18.500 --> 11:19.490
R-Right!

11:19.490 --> 11:22.320
I... I'm not taking that drug!

11:23.140 --> 11:27.800
I was difficult, and I was rough. 
And could you imagine the old me crocheting?

11:27.800 --> 11:31.120
I don't want to be that kind of girl anymore.

11:31.120 --> 11:31.870
I...

11:32.250 --> 11:33.630
I want to stay like this!

11:35.330 --> 11:36.630
What?

11:39.940 --> 11:40.840
Karane.

11:42.540 --> 11:44.200
Can we go for a walk?

11:46.100 --> 11:49.640
Karane refused to take 
medicine? What a child.

11:49.640 --> 11:52.270
I don't think that was the point, really.

11:55.700 --> 11:58.530
Your hand's so warm, Rentaro-kun.

11:59.880 --> 12:03.280
You know, I like holding hands with you.

12:03.690 --> 12:04.670
I love it.

12:05.690 --> 12:09.290
I've always wanted to tell you. 
I just couldn't.

12:10.050 --> 12:11.040
I knew that.

12:17.380 --> 12:20.820
Do you know why I chose 
to go out with you back then?

12:20.820 --> 12:23.550
Huh? Well...

12:23.930 --> 12:28.170
It's simple. It's because 
I fell in love with you.

12:29.370 --> 12:32.430
You were strong-willed but kind,

12:32.890 --> 12:35.740
shy, and a little bit difficult.

12:36.060 --> 12:38.840
But all of that made you so gosh darn cute.

12:38.840 --> 12:41.270
That day, I fell in love with...

12:43.160 --> 12:45.030
the Karane that was a tsundere.

12:46.500 --> 12:51.520
If this is truly, from the bottom of 
your heart, the Karane you want to be,

12:51.520 --> 12:57.330
then I'll support you all the way, 
and I'll do my best to love you all the same.

12:59.060 --> 13:03.080
But if you want to change 
because you hated who you were,

13:03.080 --> 13:04.840
I'll never accept it.

13:05.140 --> 13:08.020
I won't let anyone, 
not even you, look down on her...

13:08.590 --> 13:12.360
the Karane I love the most 
in the whole wide world.

13:15.140 --> 13:16.350
I want to go back.

13:17.210 --> 13:19.840
I want to go back to who I used to be.

13:20.320 --> 13:24.240
I want to be the person 
you fell in love with, Rentaro-kun!

13:30.490 --> 13:32.990
Whew, finally done.

13:33.460 --> 13:36.340
Tsunderefying Medicine!

13:33.790 --> 13:36.210
<b>Caused like
5 explosions</b>

13:36.540 --> 13:37.250
<b>Anno</b>

13:36.730 --> 13:40.840
<i>"She transmuted it over the A.D. break!"</i>

13:37.290 --> 13:38.000
<b>Domini</b>

13:40.840 --> 13:43.510
Depending on how you watch, 
there might not even have been an ad break.

13:44.300 --> 13:45.510
Karane.

13:50.220 --> 13:51.890
<b>Gulp...</b>

13:50.270 --> 13:51.130
Gulp...

13:51.130 --> 13:51.890
...indeed.

13:51.300 --> 13:51.890
<b>indeed</b>

13:56.150 --> 13:56.980
My body!

13:57.730 --> 13:59.340
It's glowing.

13:59.340 --> 14:00.110
Mmhm.

14:00.780 --> 14:07.930
The De-Tsundere-fy Medicine forcibly 
expelled brain signals that power tsundere,

14:07.930 --> 14:10.010
AKA the Tsunderays.

14:10.010 --> 14:14.040
Tsunderefying Medicine 
absorbs them into body instead.

14:15.110 --> 14:17.370
Did it succeed?

14:19.590 --> 14:20.380
Well?

14:22.170 --> 14:25.630
<b>sparkle</b>

14:22.180 --> 14:24.080
Am I back to being a tsundere?

14:24.080 --> 14:25.630
Not one bit!

14:25.630 --> 14:31.570
No...Tsunderays released
from Karane gone now.

14:31.570 --> 14:32.980
What's that mean?

14:32.980 --> 14:34.890
No going back...

14:36.390 --> 14:37.890
No...

14:39.670 --> 14:40.860
There has to be a way!

14:41.680 --> 14:45.730
There has to be another way somehow!

14:45.730 --> 14:47.780
And I swear I'll find it!

14:48.070 --> 14:49.530
Rentaro-kun...

14:50.020 --> 14:54.830
Look how late it is. 
We should all be going back home...

14:54.830 --> 15:00.080
But I wonder if Karane-chan's 
tsundere loss will distress her parents.

15:00.080 --> 15:01.920
Can we not talk like it's memory loss?

15:02.220 --> 15:07.230
Wh-What if you try acting like a tsundere?

15:07.230 --> 15:10.070
<i>"That's a good idea, partner."</i>

15:11.230 --> 15:13.690
Yeah. Okay, Meme-chan.

15:13.690 --> 15:15.630
Say something nice about me.

15:15.630 --> 15:17.430
Huh? I-I'll try...

15:17.730 --> 15:26.080
Erm... Unlike me, you're confident 
and speak your mind. It's amazing.

15:26.080 --> 15:31.140
Your golden hair is very fetching, 
you're impressively strong,

15:31.140 --> 15:33.320
and you have striking eyes and teeth!

15:33.320 --> 15:35.450
And then... And then!

15:36.070 --> 15:38.450
It's not like that delights me 
or anything, okay?

15:38.450 --> 15:39.840
This hurts to watch.

15:39.840 --> 15:42.830
She always was easy to please, though.

15:43.300 --> 15:45.200
Do you want to come over?

15:45.200 --> 15:50.280
It won't be the first time, 
so your parents won't worry.

15:50.280 --> 15:51.340
Is that okay?

15:51.340 --> 15:53.220
You know what they say about when in need.

15:54.350 --> 15:56.220
Your esteemed ulterior motives!

15:56.640 --> 15:58.270
<i>Is this safe?</i>

15:58.270 --> 16:01.330
<i>Can we really leave Karane with 
Hahari-sana in her current state?</i>

16:01.330 --> 16:03.730
<i>And that very justified concern...</i>

16:04.670 --> 16:05.730
I'm so chuffed.

16:06.000 --> 16:07.980
We get Rentaro-chan staying over, too.

16:09.590 --> 16:10.990
<i>...led to this.</i>

16:10.990 --> 16:16.490
Kawane-chan! Let's take a bath together 
and scwub each other <i>all</i> over!

16:17.580 --> 16:20.200
You'll have to kill me to get to her.

16:21.450 --> 16:22.830
I could never!

16:22.830 --> 16:25.330
I couldn't fight you either, Hahari-san!

16:29.460 --> 16:31.720
<b>The Blursed One went to bathe with the maid.</b>

16:32.710 --> 16:33.680
Hakari?

16:33.680 --> 16:39.310
Oh, this just reminds me of 
way back when it was just us three.

16:40.120 --> 16:45.310
True... It all started with us three.

16:48.180 --> 16:51.820
Don't worry, Karane. 
We'll get you back, I promise.

16:53.960 --> 16:56.570
Rentaro-kun, Hakari-chan.

16:56.960 --> 17:02.040
According to Kusuri-senpai, 
everyone generates at least some Tsunderays.

17:02.040 --> 17:05.030
Even you should be able 
to emit a little right now.

17:06.370 --> 17:07.750
So I came up with an idea.

17:08.530 --> 17:12.170
By exposing her to this 
currently weak signal repeatedly,

17:12.170 --> 17:19.100
we could spark Karane's original 
innate, potent tsundere response.

17:19.440 --> 17:24.600
Do you mean repeatedly doing things 
that could elicit a tsundere response?

17:24.600 --> 17:29.630
Yeah, but this is just a theory. 
There's no guarantee it'll work.

17:29.630 --> 17:30.860
Will you still give it a shot?

17:30.860 --> 17:34.360
O-Of course. If anything, 
I should be asking you.

17:34.650 --> 17:36.560
Okay, here we go.

17:37.490 --> 17:40.150
I love you the most in the 
whole wide world, Karane!

17:41.070 --> 17:43.920
Do you love me, Karane?

17:43.920 --> 17:45.250
I... I...

17:45.250 --> 17:47.750
<i>The tsundere Karane-san 
would respond like so.</i>

17:47.750 --> 17:51.020
Telling me you love me doesn't 
make me the least bit happy!

